- **Complete**: exact match. A match is successful only if the AS path in the match condition is the same as the AS path of the route to be matched.', example='Include', position='Query'),
  cenId: string(name='CenId', description='The instance ID of the Cloud Enterprise Network (CEN) instance.

This parameter is required.', example='cen-7qthudw0ll6jmc****', position='Query'),
